{
  "_comment": "Per-CLI config. 'safe'/'dangerous' launch interactive sessions. 'oneshot_safe'/'oneshot_dangerous' power Collab Mode. Use {prompt} for a bounded inline prompt, {prompt_file} when the CLI supports a file, or no placeholder to pipe stdin. 'oneshot_env' applies validated string environment overrides only to one-shot children. 'probe' is a non-mutating readiness check. Edit freely.",
