    "_note": "Uses your Cursor subscription via the native Windows agent CLI. No model pinned; the account default applies (run agent models to pin one). Print mode has full write access by default, so the safe one-shot seat pins --mode ask; --trust prevents the headless workspace-trust prompt from hanging bounded calls. CURSOR_API_KEY is stripped so calls never silently fall back to metered API billing."
  },
